{"version":1,"content":"<p>每次去日本，總有一大堆要排隊或訂位的美食店，其實當地很多人氣餐廳都在港開設海外分店，近日就有不同日式主題題店登場，再加上有過江龍店推出新菜單，更加吸引。</p><p>&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;鹹香明太子&lt;br/&gt;剛於銅鑼灣開</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-14T06:20:50.362172+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":103,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-14T06:00:58+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-14T06:14:03.313327+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-14T06:14:03.313327+00:00","content_hash":"25518b9e14641d6ac42cd968e9fdea0d3c24a2ca9f5e9efce92cdbe3409a1818","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}